#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:212
msgid ""
"Once the feature is enabled, an intervention is billed whenever it is linked "
"to a sales order. This occurs when:"
msgstr "启用该功能后，只要干预与销售订单关联，就会进行计费。这发生在以下情况："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:215
msgid ""
"The intervention was :ref:`planned from a sales order <planning/shifts-sales-"
"orders>`."
msgstr "干预是\\ :ref:`从销售订单规划的 <planning/shifts-sales-orders>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:216
msgid ""
"A sales order was :ref:`selected on the shift <planning/field-service/"
"shifts>`."
msgstr "在班次上\\ :ref:`选择了销售订单 <planning/field-service/shifts>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:217
msgid ""
":ref:`Products were added <planning/field-service/products>` from the shift "
"form, provided the shift is not marked as :guilabel:`Under Warranty`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`从班次表单添加了产品 <planning/field-service/products>`\\ ，前提是该班"
"次未标记为\\ :guilabel:`在保修期内`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:219
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Service to Bill` is :ref:`defined on the form of the "
"employee(s) <planning/field-service/employee-service>` assigned as the "
"shift's :guilabel:`Resources`."
msgstr ""
"\\ :guilabel:`待开票服务`\\ 已\\ :ref:`在员工表单上定义 <planning/field-"
"service/employee-service>`\\ ，该员工被指定为该班次的\\ :guilabel:`资源`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:223
msgid ":ref:`Invoice a sales order <accounting/inv-process/so>`"
msgstr ":ref:`为销售订单开具发票 <accounting/inv-process/so>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:224
