msgstr ":doc:`Odoo 销售文档 </applications/sales/sales>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:227
msgid "Time-based invoicing"
msgstr "基于时间的开票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:229
msgid ""
"To invoice the actual time spent on an intervention, the :doc:`Project <../"
"project>` and :doc:`Timesheets <../timesheets>` apps must be installed, and "
"the following must be defined on the :ref:`shift form <planning/create-"
"shift>`:"
msgstr ""
"要对干预实际花费的时间开具发票，必须安装\\ :doc:`项目 <../project>`\\ 和\\ "
":doc:`工时单 <../timesheets>`\\ 应用，并且必须在\\ :ref:`班次表单 <planning/"
"create-shift>`\\ 上定义以下内容："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:233
msgid ":guilabel:`Resources`: Assign at least one employee to the shift."
msgstr ":guilabel:`资源`：为班次指派至少一名员工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:234
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Project`: The project linked to the shift must be configured "
"as :guilabel:`Billable`, and :guilabel:`Timesheets` must be enabled in "
"the :ref:`project's settings <project_management/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`项目`：与班次关联的项目必须配置为\\ :guilabel:`可计费`\\ ，且"
"\\ :guilabel:`工时单`\\ 必须在\\ :ref:`项目设置 <project_management/"
"configuration>`\\ 中启用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:238
msgid ""
"The sales order's service is then invoiced based on the "
"shift's :guilabel:`Allocated Time`, which is updated upon shift :ref:`start "
"and completion <planning/field-service/record>`."
msgstr ""
"销售订单的服务随后将根据班次的\\ :guilabel:`已分配时间`\\ 开具发票，该时间会"
"在班次\\ :ref:`开始和完成 <planning/field-service/record>`\\ 时更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:243
msgid ""
"If an employee's work is billed at a specific rate or with extra fees, "
"define a dedicated product on the employee's form. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Planning --> Configuration --> Employees`, select the "
"relevant employee, go to the :guilabel:`Settings` tab, and select the "
"relevant :guilabel:`Service to Bill` in the :guilabel:`Planning` section."
msgstr ""
"如果员工的工作按特定费率计费或收取额外费用，请在该员工的表单上定义专用产品。"
"为此，请前往\\ :menuselection:`排班 --> 配置 --> 员工`\\ ，选择相应员工，前往"
"\\ :guilabel:`设置`\\ 选项卡，然后选择相关的\\ :guilabel:`待开票服务`\\ （位"
"于\\ :guilabel:`排班`\\ 部分）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:248
msgid ""
"The service defined for the employee is added to the sales order linked to "
"the intervention, if applicable. Otherwise, a sales order is created with "
"the employee's service when the shift is marked as completed, and invoiced "
"based on the time spent on the intervention."
msgstr ""
"若适用，为员工定义的服务将添加到与该现场作业关联的销售订单中。否则，当班次标"
"记为已完成时，将使用该员工的服务创建销售订单，并根据现场作业所用的时间开具发"
"票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:255
msgid "Products"
msgstr "产品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:257
msgid ""
"Materials used during interventions can be recorded directly from field "
"service shifts and billed to customers."
msgstr "现场作业中使用的物料可以直接在现场服务班次中记录，并向客户开具发票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:260
msgid ""
"To add products to a shift, go to :menuselection:`Planning --> Configuration "
"--> Settings` and ensure the :ref:`Billing <planning/field-service/"
"invoicing>` and :guilabel:`Products` features are enabled. Then, follow "
"these steps:"
msgstr ""
"要向班次添加产品，请前往\\ :menuselection:`排班 --> 配置 --> 设置`\\ 并确保已"
"启用\\ :ref:`开票 <planning/field-service/invoicing>`\\ 与\\ :guilabel:`产品"
"`\\ 功能。然后，按照以下步骤操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:264
msgid ""
":ref:`Sign in to the shift <planning/field-service/record>` or :ref:`edit "
"<planning/shifts-edit>` an ongoing shift."
msgstr ""
":ref:`签入班次 <planning/field-service/record>`\\ 或\\ :ref:`编辑 <planning/"
"shifts-edit>`\\ 进行中的班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:266
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`0 Products` button."
msgstr "点击\\ :guilabel:`0 个产品`\\ 按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:267
msgid "Click :icon:`fa-shopping-cart` :guilabel:`Add` on a product card."
msgstr "点击产品卡片上的\\ :icon:`fa-shopping-cart` :guilabel:`添加`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:268
msgid ""
"Adjust the product quantity, if needed, using the :guilabel:`-` "
"and :guilabel:`+` buttons."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可使用\\ :guilabel:`-`\\ 和\\ :guilabel:`+`\\ 按钮调整产品数量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:269
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Back` to return to the shift."
msgstr "点击\\ :guilabel:`返回`\\ 即可返回班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:271
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Products` button displays the number of products added to the "
"shift. Click it to add more."
msgstr ""
"该\\ :guilabel:`产品`\\ 按钮显示已添加到班次的产品数量。点击该按钮可添加更多"
"产品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:275
msgid ""
"To locate a product more easily in the catalog, use the search bar and "
"filter by :guilabel:`Product Category` or :ref:`Attributes <products/"
"variants/attributes>`."
msgstr ""
"要在目录中更轻松地查找产品，请使用搜索栏并按\\ :guilabel:`产品类别`\\ 或"
"\\ :ref:`属性 <products/variants/attributes>`\\ 进行筛选。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:277
msgid ""
"To create or edit products from the Planning app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Planning --> Configuration --> Products`."
msgstr ""
"要从“排班”应用创建或编辑产品，请前往\\ :menuselection:`排班 --> 配置 --> 产品"
"`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:281
msgid ""
"Adding products from a shift requires the :guilabel:`User: All Documents` "
"(or :guilabel:`Administrator`) :guilabel:`Sales` :doc:`access right </"
"applications/general/users/access_rights>`."
msgstr ""
"从班次添加产品需要拥有\\ :guilabel:`用户：所有文档`\\ （或\\ :guilabel:`管理"
"员`\\ ）的\\ :guilabel:`销售`\\ :doc:`访问权限 </applications/general/users/"
"access_rights>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:284
msgid ""
"Any products added to the shift are added to the related sales order. If no "
"sales order is linked to the shift, a new one is created automatically. To "
"access it, click the :guilabel:`Sales Order` smart button on the shift form."
msgstr ""
"添加到班次的所有产品都会同步添加到相关的销售订单中。如果班次未关联任何销售订"
"单，系统将自动创建一个新的销售订单。要访问该订单，请点击班次表单上的"
"\\ :guilabel:`销售订单`\\ 智能按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:287
msgid ""
"Products added to shifts marked as :guilabel:`Under Warranty` are not "
"invoiced; their price is automatically set to `0` on the sales order."
msgstr ""
"添加到标记为\\ :guilabel:`保修期内`\\ 的班次中的产品不会开具发票；销售订单上"
"的价格会自动设置为 `0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:293
msgid "Quotations"
msgstr "报价"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:295
msgid ""
"Quotations can be created directly from field service shifts, for example, "
"when additional work or materials are identified during an intervention. To "
"activate this feature, go to :menuselection:`Planning --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, ensure the :guilabel:`Billing` setting is activated in "
"the :guilabel:`Field Service` section, then enable :guilabel:`Quotations`, "
"and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"报价单可以直接从现场服务班次中创建，例如在现场作业期间发现了额外的工作或物"
"料。要启用此功能，请前往\\ :menuselection:`排班 --> 配置 --> 设置`\\ ，确保"
"\\ :guilabel:`开票`\\ 设置在\\ :guilabel:`现场服务`\\ 部分已激活，然后启用"
"\\ :guilabel:`报价单`\\ ，并点击\\ :guilabel:`保存`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:301
msgid ""
"To create a quotation from a shift, click the :guilabel:`Quotations` smart "
"button on the shift form, then click :guilabel:`New` and :ref:`fill in the "
"fields <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>`."
msgstr ""
"要从班次创建报价单，请点击班次表单上的\\ :guilabel:`报价单`\\ 智能按钮，然后"
"点击\\ :guilabel:`新建`\\ 并\\ :ref:`填写字段 <sales/create_quotations/"
"create-quotation>`\\ 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:307
msgid "Customer report"
msgstr "客户报表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:309
msgid ""
"When interventions are :ref:`billed <planning/field-service/invoicing>` and/"
"or when :ref:`worksheets <planning/field-service/worksheets>` are used, a "
"customer report is generated automatically upon shift completion. It details "
"the materials and services provided, the time spent, and the completed "
"worksheet (if applicable)."
msgstr ""
"当现场作业进行\\ :ref:`开票 <planning/field-service/invoicing>`\\ 和/或使用"
"\\ :ref:`工作表 <planning/field-service/worksheets>`\\ 时，班次完成时将自动生"
"成客户报告。报告中详细列出了所提供的物料和服务、所用时间以及填写完毕的工作表"
"（如适用）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:315
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Customer Report` feature is activated by default when "
"the :guilabel:`Billing` or :guilabel:`Worksheets` feature is enabled in "
"the :guilabel:`Field Service` section of the Planning settings ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:319
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Customer Preview` smart button on the shift form to "
"access the report, then click :guilabel:`Sign Report` to collect the "
"customer's :ref:`signature <sign/sign-document/initials-signature>` and send "
"the report to the customer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:324
msgid ""
"To exclude prices from the customer report for :ref:`billed <planning/field-"
"service/invoicing>` interventions, go to :menuselection:`Planning --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, ensure the :guilabel:`Billing` "
"and :guilabel:`Products` features are activated, enable :guilabel:`Hide "
"prices on customer report`, and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project.rst:8
