msgstr "这样就可以启用一个新菜单，分为四个部分："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`View`: see an overview of your project's components, such as "
"its :guilabel:`Tasks`, :guilabel:`Milestones` and :guilabel:`Project "
"Updates`. Depending on which apps you have activated, more options may be "
"available, such as :guilabel:`Documents`. All uploaded files can be found "
"under this menu, as well as in the **Documents** app, "
"under :guilabel:`Projects`;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`查看`：查看项目组件概览，如 :guilabel:`任务`、:guilabel:`里程碑` "
"和 :guilabel:`项目更新`。根据您激活的应用程序，可能会有更多选项，例"
"如 :guilabel:`文件`。所有上传的文件都可在此菜单下找到，也可在**文件**应用程序"
"的 :guilabel:`项目`下找到；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reporting`: analyze your project's progress and profitability "
"through graphics and statistics;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`报告`: 通过图形和统计数据来分析项目的进度和盈利能力；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Color**: make a line of color appear on the left side of the card so that "
"your project is more recognizable;"
msgstr "**颜色**：在贺卡的左侧加上一条颜色线，这样您的项目就更容易辨认了；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:39
msgid ":guilabel:`Settings`: you can change the following:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`设置`: 您可以更改以下内容："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:41
msgid "the :guilabel:`Name` of the project;"
msgstr "项目的:guilabel:`名称`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:42
msgid "the :guilabel:`Name of the tasks` found under that project;"
msgstr "该项目下的 :guilabel:`任务名称`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:43
msgid "the :guilabel:`Customer` for whom the project is intended;"
msgstr "面向:guilabel:`客户`的项目；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:44
msgid "the :guilabel:`Tags` used for filtering;"
msgstr "用于筛选的 :guilabel:` 标签`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:45
msgid "the :guilabel:`Company` responsible for the project;"
msgstr "负责项目的:guilabel:`公司`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:46
msgid "the employee designated as :guilabel:`Project Manager`;"
msgstr "员工被指定为:guilabel:`项目经理`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:47
msgid "the :guilabel:`Planned Date` of the project;"
msgstr "项目的 :guilabel:`计划日期`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:48
msgid "the total :guilabel:`Allocated Hours` for that project."
msgstr "项目总计:guilabel:`分配小时数`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:50
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can mark the project as :guilabel:`Favorite`, allowing you "
"to find it using the :guilabel:`My Favorites` filter on the Kanban view;"
msgstr ""
"此外，您还可以将项目标记为 :guilabel:`收藏夹`，这样您就可以使用看板视图上"
"的 :guilabel:`我的收藏夹` 筛选器找到它；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:53
msgid "Project settings"
msgstr "项目设置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:58
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Customize projects <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/"
"customize-projects-3615?fullscreen=1>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo 教程：自定义项目<https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/customize-"
"projects-3615?fullscreen=1>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:61
msgid ""
"Further settings are available under the :guilabel:`Settings` tab. Most of "
"them are *only* available depending on the activated apps."
msgstr ""
"更多设置可在 :guilabel:`设置` 标签下查看。其中大部分设置*仅*取决于已激活的应"
"用程序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:65
msgid "Visibility and collaboration"
msgstr "可见性与协作"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:67
msgid ""
"Odoo allows you to set visibility settings for each project, enabling you to "
"make your project available to everyone in your organization or restrict "
"access to certain internal or external users."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 允许您为每个项目设置可见性，使您可以让组织中的所有人都能访问项目，或将访"
"问权限限制为特定的内部或外部用户。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:70
msgid ""
"To do so, go to the project's :guilabel:`Settings` tab and choose the "
"desired :guilabel:`Visibility` option:"
msgstr ""
"要进行设置，请转到项目的:guilabel:`设置`选项卡，然后选择所需的:guilabel:`可见"
"性`选项："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invited internal users (private)`: Only users following the "
"project and users with the Project Administrator :doc:`access right </"
"applications/general/users/access_rights>` can access the project and its "
"tasks."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`受邀的内部用户（私有）`：只有关注该项目的用户以及具有项目管理"
"员:doc:`访问权限 </applications/general/users/access_rights>`的用户才能访问该"
"项目及其任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`All internal users`: All internal users can access the project "
"and all of its tasks."
msgstr ":guilabel:`所有内部用户`：所有内部用户都可以访问该项目及其所有任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invited portal users and all internal users (public)`: All "
"internal users can access the project and all of its tasks. When following a "
"project, :doc:`portal users </applications/general/users/user_portals>` only "
"have access to the specific tasks they are following. This option is "
"selected by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`受邀的门户用户和所有内部用户（公开）`：所有内部用户可以访问该项目"
"及其所有任务。在关注项目时，:doc:`门户用户 </applications/general/users/"
"user_portals>` 仅可以访问他们关注的特定任务。此选项默认选中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:83
msgid "Inviting external users"
msgstr "邀请外部用户"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:85
msgid ""
"To invite external users, make sure that :guilabel:`Invited portal users and "
"all internal users (public)` is selected, then click :guilabel:`Share "
"Project` at the top of the project’s settings. The following options are "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"要邀请外部用户，请确保选择了:guilabel:`受邀的门户用户和所有内部用户（公开）"
"`，然后单击项目设置顶部的:guilabel:`共享项目`。可用选项如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:89
msgid ""
"Copy and share the :guilabel:`Public Link` displayed at the top of the pop-"
"up window. Anyone with this link can access the project in read mode."
msgstr ""
"复制并共享弹出窗口顶部显示的:guilabel:`公开链接`。任何拥有此链接的人都可以以"
"只读模式访问该项目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:91
msgid ""
"Or click :guilabel:`Add a line`, select a :guilabel:`Collaborator`, choose "
"the :guilabel:`Access Mode`, and check the box to send an invitation to "
"their email address."
msgstr ""
"或单击:guilabel:`添加一行`，选择一个:guilabel:`协作者`，选择:guilabel:`访问模"
"式`，然后勾选复选框以向其电子邮件地址发送邀请。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:94
msgid "There are three types of :guilabel:`Access Mode` for collaborators:"
msgstr "协作者有三种:guilabel:`访问模式`类型："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:96
msgid ":guilabel:`Read`: Collaborators can view tasks but cannot edit them."
msgstr ":guilabel:`只读`：协作者可以查看任务但无法编辑。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Edit with limited access`: Collaborators can view and edit the "
"tasks they follow."
msgstr ":guilabel:`有限访问权限编辑`：协作者可以查看和编辑他们关注的任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:98
msgid ":guilabel:`Edit`: Collaborators can view and edit all tasks."
msgstr ":guilabel:`编辑`：协作者可以查看和编辑所有任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:100
msgid ""
"To revoke an invited collaborator's access, click :guilabel:`Share Project` "
"at the top of the project’s settings, then click the :icon:`fa-trash-"
"o` :guilabel:`(trash)` icon."
msgstr ""
"要撤销受邀协作者的访问权限，请点击项目设置顶部的:guilabel:`共享项目`，然后点"
"击:icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`（垃圾桶）`图标。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:104
msgid ""
"Internal users without access to the project can still access a task if the "
"URL has been shared with them. For projects set as :guilabel:`Invited "
"internal users (private)`, they must also be a follower of the task."
msgstr ""
"没有项目访问权限的内部用户，如果URL已与他们共享，仍可以访问任务。对于设置"
"为:guilabel:`受邀内部用户（私有）`的项目，他们还必须是任务的关注者。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:109
msgid "Scheduling activities"
msgstr "安排活动"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:111
msgid ""
"You can schedule **activities** (ex. :guilabel:`Call`, :guilabel:`Meeting`, "
"etc.) per project by clicking on the **clock** icon on a project. Doing so "
"opens a list with already scheduled activities and allows planning **new** "
"activities by clicking :guilabel:`+ Schedule an activity`. On the pop-up "
"window, select the :guilabel:`Activity Type`, enter a :guilabel:`Summary` "
"for that activity, a :guilabel:`Due Date`, and assign it to an employee. "
"According to the :guilabel:`Activity Type`, you may have **additional "
"options** available."
msgstr ""
"通过点击项目上的**时钟**图标，您可以为每个项目安排**活动**（如 :guilabel:`通"
"话`、:guilabel:`会议`等）。点击:guilabel:`+ 安排活动`，将打开已计划活动的列"
"表，并可计划**新**活动。在弹出窗口中，选择 :guilabel:`活动类型`，输入活动"
"的 :guilabel:`简介`、:guilabel:`截止日期`，并将其分配给员工。根据 :guilabel:`"
"活动类型`，您可能有**附加选项**可用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:119
msgid ""
"If an activity is **already** scheduled, the icon may change to a **phone**, "
"**group of people**, or other."
msgstr "如果活动 **已** 安排，图标可能会变为**电话**、**人群**或其他。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:125
msgid "Top bar"
msgstr "顶部栏"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:127
msgid ""
"In project management, reviewing the various records and documents related "
"to a project is often necessary. Odoo Project’s **top bar** provides quick "
"access to these essential resources. You can customize each project's top "
"bar to match its specific needs."
msgstr ""
"在项目管理中，查看与项目相关的各种记录和文档通常是必要的。Odoo项目的**顶部栏"
"**可快速访问这些基本资源。您可以自定义每个项目的顶部栏以满足其特定需求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:131
msgid ""
"To set up the top bar for a project, go to the :guilabel:`Project` app, "
"click the project's card, then click the top bar :icon:`fa-"
"sliders` :guilabel:`(sliders)` button. In the bar that appears above the "
"search bar, click the :icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`(sliders)` button to "
"select the records you want to display, such as timesheets, sales orders, "
"invoices, documents, dashboards, etc."
msgstr ""
"要为项目设置顶部栏，请进入:guilabel:`项目`应用，点击项目卡片，然后点击顶部栏"
"的:icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`（滑块）`按钮。在搜索栏上方出现的栏中，点"
"击:icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`（滑块）`按钮以选择要显示的记录，例如工时单、"
"销售订单、发票、文档、统计面板等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:136
msgid ""
"You can then click the buttons to access the related records without leaving "
"the Project app. To return to your project tasks' Kanban view, click "
"the :guilabel:`Tasks` button in the top bar."
msgstr ""
"然后您可以点击按钮访问相关记录，而无需离开项目应用。要返回项目任务的看板视"
"图，请点击顶部栏中的:guilabel:`任务`按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:139
msgid "Top bar selection menu"
msgstr "顶部栏选择菜单"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:143
msgid "Custom top bar buttons"
msgstr "自定义顶部栏按钮"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:145
msgid "You can also create your own buttons to access more specific views:"
msgstr "您还可以创建自己的按钮来访问更具体的视图："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:147
msgid "Click an existing top bar button to access the view."
msgstr "点击现有的顶部栏按钮以访问视图。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:148
msgid ""
"Customize the view with keywords, filters, and grouping options using the "
"search bar."
msgstr "使用搜索栏中的关键字、筛选器和分组选项自定义视图。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:149
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`(sliders)` button in the top bar and "
"select :guilabel:`Save View`."
msgstr ""
"点击顶部栏中的:icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`（滑块）`按钮，然后选"
"择:guilabel:`保存视图`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management.rst:151
msgid ""
"Edit the default button name if necessary, then enable :guilabel:`Shared` if "
"you want to share the button with other users."
msgstr ""
"如有必要，编辑默认按钮名称，然后如果要与其他用户共享该按钮，请启用:guilabel:`"
"共享`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:3
msgid "Project dashboard"
msgstr "项目仪表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:5
msgid ""
"The project dashboard allows you to get a comprehensive overview of your "
"project's status. It displays information such as the total number of tasks, "
"timesheets, and planned hours linked to the project, as well as detailed "
"information about project milestones and its costs and revenues. Within the "
"project dashboard, you can create :guilabel:`Project updates`, which allow "
"you to take a snapshot of the project's status at a certain point in time. "
"As such, it is a crucial tool for effective project management and ensuring "
"that your project stays on track."
msgstr ""
"项目仪表板可让您全面掌握项目状态。它会显示与项目关联的任务总数、工时表和计划"
"工时等信息，以及项目里程碑、成本和收入的详细信息。在项目仪表板中，您可以创"
"建 :guilabel:`项目更新`，以此记录项目在特定时间点的状态快照。因此，它是一项至"
"关重要的工具，有助于实现高效的项目管理，并确保项目始终按计划推进。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:13
msgid "Using the project dashboard"
msgstr "使用项目仪表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:15
msgid ""
"To access the project dashboard, open the **Project** app and navigate to "
"the applicable project. Click the :icon:`fa-sliders` (:guilabel:`sliders`) "
"icon to add :guilabel:`Dashboard` to the project's :ref:`top bar <project/"
"project-management/top-bar>`."
msgstr ""
"要访问项目仪表板，请打开**项目**应用并导航至相应项目。点击 :icon:`fa-sliders`"
"（:guilabel:`滑块`）图标，即可将 :guilabel:`仪表板` 添加到项目的 :ref:`顶部"
"栏 <project/project-management/top-bar>` 中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:20
msgid ""
"You can also access the project dashboard by hovering over the desired "
"project’s card, clicking the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`), and selecting :guilabel:`Dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"您还可以将鼠标悬停在目标项目的卡片上，点击 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`（:guilabel:`"
"垂直省略号`），然后选择 :guilabel:`仪表板`，以此访问项目仪表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:23
msgid ""
"The left side of the dashboard displays a list of existing :ref:`project "
"updates <project/project-dashboard/updates>`, and the right side "
"provides :ref:`detailed information about records linked to the project "
"<project/project-dashboard/smart-buttons>`, as well as :ref:`milestones "
"<project/project-dashboard/milestones>`, :ref:`profitability <project/"
"project-dashboard/profitability>`, and :ref:`budgets <project/project-"
"dashboard/budgets>`."
msgstr ""
"仪表板的左侧显示现有 :ref:`项目更新 <project/project-dashboard/updates>` 的列"
"表，右侧则提供 :ref:`与该项目关联的记录的详细信息 <project/project-dashboard/"
"smart-buttons>`，以及 :ref:`里程碑 <project/project-dashboard/"
"milestones>`、 :ref:`盈利能力 <project/project-dashboard/profitability>`，以"
"及 :ref:`预算 <project/project-dashboard/budgets>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:30
msgid ""
"The information displayed on the project dashboard varies depending on the "
"applications installed on your database. For example, you will not see "
"information about **Timesheets**, **Planning**, or **Purchase Orders** if "
"the corresponding applications are not installed."
msgstr ""
"项目仪表板上显示的信息会根据数据库中安装的应用程序而有所不同。例如，如果未安"
"装相应的应用程序，您将无法看到有关**工时单**、**排期**或**采购订单**的信息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:37
msgid "Totals smart buttons"
msgstr "汇总智能按钮"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:39
msgid ""
"The following smart buttons are displayed on the top right of the project "
"dashboard:"
msgstr "项目仪表板右上角会显示以下智能按钮："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tasks`: the number of completed (i.e., :guilabel:`Done` "
"or :guilabel:`Canceled` :ref:`tasks <project/tasks/task_stages_statuses/"
"statuses>`) and all tasks, in format completed/all, as well as the entire "
"project's completion percentage estimation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`任务`：已完成任务（即 :guilabel:`已完成` 或 :guilabel:`已取消"
"` :ref:`任务 <project/tasks/task_stages_statuses/statuses>`）的数量与所有任务"
"的数量，格式为“已完成/总数”，以及整个项目的预计完成百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Timesheets`: the number of hours or days (depending on the "
"**Timesheets** app configuration) allocated in the project’s **settings**. "
"This includes all :doc:`timesheets </applications/services/timesheets>`, "
"whether or not they have been validated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工时单`：在项目**设置**中分配的小时数或天数（具体取决于**工时单**"
"应用的配置）。这包括所有 :doc:`工时单 </applications/services/timesheets>`，"
"无论它们是否已通过验证。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Planned`: the number of hours that have been planned for shifts "
"in the **Planning** app. This includes all :doc:`planned shifts </"
"applications/services/planning>`, including past shifts and shifts that have "
"not yet been published."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`排期`：在**排期**应用中为班次安排的总小时数。这包括所有 :doc:`已计"
"划的班次 </applications/services/planning>`，涵盖已过去的班次以及尚未发布的班"
"次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Documents`: number of :doc:`documents </applications/productivity/"
"documents>` in the project’s workspace."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`文档`：项目工作区中 :doc:`文档 </applications/productivity/"
"documents>` 的数量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Burndown Chart`: click the smart button to access a :doc:`report "
"</applications/essentials/reporting>` on the status of the project’s tasks "
"over time."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`燃尽图`：点击智能按钮，即可查看一份关于项目任务随时间推移状态"
"的 :doc:`报告 </applications/essentials/reporting>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Timesheets and Planning`: click the smart button to access "
"a :doc:`report </applications/essentials/reporting>` on the project’s "
"timesheets and shifts. This allows you to easily compare planned and "
"effective hours of work on the project."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工时单与排期`：点击智能按钮，即可查看关于项目工时表和班次的 :doc:`"
"报告 </applications/essentials/reporting>`。这使您能够轻松比较项目中计划工时"
"与实际工时。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Additional fields**, such as :guilabel:`Sales Orders`, :guilabel:`Sales "
"Order Items`, :guilabel:`Purchase Orders`, and more, represent the number of "
"records linked to the project."
msgstr ""
"**其他字段**，例如 :guilabel:`销售订单`、 :guilabel:`销售订单明细"
"`、:guilabel:`采购订单` 等，表示与该项目关联的记录数量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:61
msgid ""
"Use the project dashboard smart buttons to update the project records "
"easily. Click :guilabel:`Timesheets` to validate "
"timesheets, :guilabel:`Planned` to create project "
"planning, :guilabel:`Documents` to view and validate documents, etc."
msgstr ""
"使用项目仪表板中的智能按钮，即可轻松更新项目记录。点击 :guilabel:`工时单` 验"
"证工时表，点击 :guilabel:`排期` 创建项目计划，点击 :guilabel:`文档` 查看和验"
"证文档等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:68
msgid "Milestones"
msgstr "里程碑"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:70
msgid ""
"This section is only visible if :doc:`milestones <../project_management/"
"project_milestones>` have been enabled in the project you're browsing: go "
"to :guilabel:`Project`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon on one of your projects, and click on :guilabel:`Settings`. "
"Click on the :guilabel:`Settings` tab, look for :guilabel:`Tasks Management` "
"and make sure :guilabel:`Milestones` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"只有在您正在浏览的项目中启用了 :doc:`里程碑 <../project_management/"
"project_milestones>` 功能时，本节才会显示：转到 :guilabel:`项目`，点击某个项"
"目上的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`（:guilabel:`垂直省略号`）图标，然后点"
"击 :guilabel:`设置`。点击 :guilabel:`设置` 选项卡，找到 :guilabel:`任务管理"
"`，并确保 :guilabel:`里程碑` 已启用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:76
msgid ""
"In a project's Dashboard, click :guilabel:`Add Milestone` to create a new "
"milestone. Click a milestone in the checklist to edit it, enable its "
"checkbox to mark it as completed, or click the :icon:`fa-trash` "
"(:guilabel:`trash`) icon to remove it."
msgstr ""
"在项目的仪表板中，点击 :guilabel:`添加里程碑` 以创建新的里程碑。点击待办事项"
"列表中的某个里程碑进行编辑，勾选其复选框将其标记为已完成，或点击 :icon:`fa-"
"trash` (:guilabel:`垃圾桶`) 图标将其删除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:80
msgid ""
"The milestones are displayed in red if they’re past their deadline, or in "
"green if they are ready to be marked as reached (i.e. tasks linked to the "
"milestone that have been marked with :guilabel:`done` "
"or :guilabel:`canceled` :ref:`status <project/tasks/task_stages_statuses/"
"statuses>`)."
msgstr ""
"如果里程碑已过截止日期，则以红色显示；如果已准备好标记为已完成（即与该里程碑"
"关联的任务已被标记为 :guilabel:`已完成` 或 :guilabel:`已取消` :ref:`状态 "
"<project/tasks/task_stages_statuses/statuses>`），则以绿色显示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:87
msgid "Profitability"
msgstr "盈利能力"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:89
msgid ""
"The :doc:`profitability dashboard </applications/services/project/"
"project_management/project_profitability>` provides a breakdown of project "
"costs and revenues, which are impacted by all records linked to the project "
"and its :doc:`Analytic account </applications/finance/accounting/reporting/"
"analytic_accounting>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`盈利能力仪表板 </applications/services/project/project_management/"
"project_profitability>` 提供了项目成本和收入的明细，这些数据会受到与该项目及"
"其 :doc:`分析账户 </applications/finance/accounting/reporting/"
"analytic_accounting>` 相关联的所有记录的影响。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:94
msgid "The profitability report is only displayed for billable projects."
msgstr "盈利能力报表仅针对可计费项目显示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:99
msgid "Budgets"
msgstr "预算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:101
msgid ""
"If a budget has been set for the project, its status and related details are "
"displayed in this section. Click :guilabel:`Add Budget` to create a new "
"budget for the project."
msgstr ""
"如果已为项目设置了预算，则此部分将显示其状态和相关详细信息。点击:guilabel:`添"
"加预算`为项目创建新预算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:105
msgid ""
":doc:`Budgets </applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget>` must be "
"enabled in your database’s **Accounting** application in order for this "
"section to be displayed."
msgstr ""
"必须在数据库的**会计**应用中启用:doc:`预算 </applications/finance/accounting/"
"reporting/budget>`，才能显示此部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:111
msgid "Project updates"
msgstr "项目更新"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:113
msgid ""
"Project updates allow you to take a snapshot of the project’s overall status "
"at a given point in time, for example, during a periodic (weekly, bi-weekly, "
"or monthly) review. This allows you to compare specific data points, note "
"any aspects of the project that need improvement, and estimate if the "
"project is on or off track."
msgstr ""
"项目更新允许您在特定时间点（例如，在定期（每周、每两周或每月）审查期间）拍摄"
"项目整体状态的快照。这使您可以比较特定数据点，记录项目中需要改进的任何方面，"
"并估计项目是否按计划进行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:118
msgid ""
"To create a new project update, go to the project dashboard, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, and fill in the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"要创建新的项目更新，请转到项目仪表板，点击:guilabel:`新建`，并填写以下字段："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:121
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Status`: Choose between :guilabel:`On Track`, :guilabel:`At "
"Risk`, :guilabel:`Off Track`, :guilabel:`On Hold`, and :guilabel:`Done`. "
"Once the status is set, a color-coded dot is displayed on the project’s "
"Kanban card, allowing the project manager to easily identify which projects "
"need attention."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`状态`:在:guilabel:`进展顺利`、:guilabel:`有风险`、:guilabel:`偏离"
"轨道`、:guilabel:`暂停`和:guilabel:`完成`之间选择。设置状态后,项目看板卡片上"
"会显示一个彩色圆点,便于项目经理轻松识别哪些项目需要关注。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:125
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Progress`: Manually input the completion percentage based on the "
"project's progress."
msgstr ":guilabel:`进度`:根据项目进度手动输入完成百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date` and :guilabel:`Author`: These fields are automatically "
"filled in with appropriate information based on the user who created the "
"update and the current date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`日期`和:guilabel:`作者`:这些字段会根据创建更新的用户和当前日期自动"
"填充相应信息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_dashboard.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: Use this rich-text field to gather notes. Depending "
"on the project configuration (e.g., if the project is billable), this field "
"may be pre-filled with current information on aspects such as profitability, "
"budget, milestones, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`描述`:使用此富文本字段收集备注。根据项目配置(例如,如果项目可计费),"
"此字段可能会预填充当前信息,如盈利能力、预算、里程碑等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:3
msgid "Project milestones"
msgstr "项目里程碑"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Milestones** enable you to track ongoing project work by designating a "
"sequence of key steps that must be reached before the project’s completion. "
"Milestones are particularly useful in expensive, long, or large-scale "
"projects. They can be used purely for indicative purposes, as a way to "
"ensure that the project is completed in a timely manner."
msgstr ""
"**里程碑**通过指定在项目完成之前必须达到的一系列关键步骤，使您能够跟踪正在进"
"行的项目工作。里程碑在昂贵、长期或大规模项目中特别有用。它们可以纯粹用于指示"
"目的，作为确保项目按时完成的方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:10
msgid ""
"Milestones can also be used as a basis for :doc:`invoicing the client </"
"applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone>`. This benefits both parties, "
"as it ensures consistent cash flow for project funding and allows the client "
"to pay for the project in several installments."
msgstr ""
"里程碑还可以作为:doc:`向客户开票 </applications/sales/sales/invoicing/"
"milestone>`的依据。这对双方都有利，因为它确保了项目资金的稳定现金流，并允许客"
"户分几期支付项目费用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:17
msgid ""
"Enable milestones for the desired project by opening the :guilabel:`Project` "
"app, clicking the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) on "
"the project’s card, and clicking :guilabel:`Settings`. "
"Under :guilabel:`Tasks Management`, enable :guilabel:`Milestones`."
msgstr ""
"通过打开:guilabel:`项目`应用程序，点击项目卡片上的:icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`"
"（:guilabel:`垂直省略号`）并点击:guilabel:`设置`，为所需项目启用里程碑。"
"在:guilabel:`任务管理`下，启用:guilabel:`里程碑`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:22
msgid ""
"Milestones are automatically enabled for projects created from a sales order "
"for a service :doc:`invoiced by milestone </applications/sales/sales/"
"invoicing/milestone>`."
msgstr ""
"对于从销售订单创建的服务项目，如果:doc:`按里程碑开票 </applications/sales/"
"sales/invoicing/milestone>`，里程碑会自动启用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:25
msgid ""
"Configure project milestones by clicking the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) on the project’s card and "
"selecting :guilabel:`Milestones`. Create a milestone by "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`, entering the milestone's :guilabel:`Name`, "
"selecting a :guilabel:`Deadline` if desired, and clicking :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"通过点击项目卡片上的\\ :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`\\ （:guilabel:`垂直省略号`）并选"
"择\\ :guilabel:`里程碑`\\ 来配置项目里程碑。点击\\ :guilabel:`新建`\\ 创建里"
"程碑，输入里程碑的\\ :guilabel:`名称`，如需要可选择\\ :guilabel:`截止日期`，"
"然后点击\\ :guilabel:`保存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:30
msgid ""
"Add or remove options by clicking the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`sliders`. The following options are relevant when "
"using :doc:`invoicing based on milestones </applications/sales/sales/"
"invoicing/milestone>`:"
msgstr ""
"通过点击\\ :icon:`oi-settings-adjust`\\ :guilabel:`滑块`\\ 来添加或删除选项。"
"以下选项在使用\\ :doc:`基于里程碑的发票 </applications/sales/sales/invoicing/"
"milestone>`\\ 时相关："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Order Item`: this field is filled in automatically with the "
"Sales Order number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`销售订单项`：此字段会自动填入销售订单编号。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quantity (%)`: percentage of the ordered quantity that will "
"automatically be delivered on the sales order once the milestone is marked "
"as reached."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`数量（%）`：已订购数量的百分比，在里程碑标记为已达成后，将自动在销"
"售订单上交付。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:38
msgid ""
"Once milestones are configured, **you can link project tasks to "
"milestones**. To do so, navigate to the project you created the milestones "
"in, then click one of the tasks to open it. Then, click "
"the :guilabel:`Milestone` field to open a drop-down menu. Select the desired "
"milestone from the list."
msgstr ""
"配置里程碑后，**您可以将项目任务关联到里程碑**。为此，导航到您创建里程碑的项"
"目，然后点击其中一个任务以打开它。接着，点击\\ :guilabel:`里程碑`\\ 字段打开"
"下拉菜单。从列表中选择所需的里程碑。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:42
msgid ""
"Once all the tasks linked to the milestone are completed (marked "
"as :doc:`Done or Cancelled <../tasks/task_stages_statuses>`), the milestone "
"will be automatically marked as :guilabel:`Reached` in "
"the :menuselection:`Project --> Settings --> Milestones`. You can also check "
"the :guilabel:`Reached` box manually whenever the milestone is reached. "
"Manual checking of the box will not impact the tasks linked to the milestone."
msgstr ""
"一旦关联到里程碑的所有任务都已完成（标记为\\ :doc:`完成或已取消 <../tasks/"
"task_stages_statuses>`），里程碑将在\\ :menuselection:`项目 --> 设置 --> 里程"
"碑`\\ 中自动标记为\\ :guilabel:`已达成`。您也可以在里程碑达成时手动勾选"
"\\ :guilabel:`已达成`\\ 复选框。手动勾选该复选框不会影响关联到里程碑的任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:51
msgid "Using milestones"
msgstr "使用里程碑"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:53
msgid ""
"Odoo offers several ways to oversee the project’s milestones and their "
"relationship to ongoing tasks."
msgstr "Odoo 提供多种方式来监督项目的里程碑及其与进行中任务的关系。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:56
msgid ""
"In the **Gantt view**, a milestone is shown as a vertical line marked with a "
"diamond shape, displayed on the day of the milestone’s deadline. The line is "
"color-coded in blue to indicate that the milestone has not yet reached its "
"deadline, or it has been marked as reached (in which case, a check mark is "
"displayed on the milestone). A milestone is color-coded in red if it has not "
"been reached by its deadline."
msgstr ""
"在**甘特图视图**中，里程碑显示为一条垂直线，标有菱形，显示在里程碑截止日期的"
"当天。该线用蓝色编码，表示里程碑尚未到达截止日期，或已标记为已达成（在这种情"
"况下，里程碑上会显示一个勾号）。如果里程碑在截止日期前未达成，则用红色编码。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:62
msgid ""
"If a milestone’s deadline falls on the same day as the project’s deadline, "
"it is displayed with a vertical line marked with a circle, and the same "
"color coding principles as above apply."
msgstr ""
"如果里程碑的截止日期与项目的截止日期在同一天，它将显示为一条标有圆圈的垂直"
"线，并应用与上述相同的颜色编码原则。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:65
msgid ""
"Aside from the Gantt view, you can also create, edit, and mark milestones as "
"reached from :ref:`the project dashboard <project/project-dashboard/"
"milestones>`."
msgstr ""
"除了甘特图视图，您还可以从\\ :ref:`项目仪表板 <project/project-dashboard/"
"milestones>`\\ 创建、编辑里程碑并将其标记为已达成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_milestones.rst:68
msgid "Project milestones in Gantt view."
msgstr "甘特图视图中的项目里程碑。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:3
msgid "Project profitability"
msgstr "项目盈利能力"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:5
msgid ""
"When handling billable projects, it is essential to determine whether your "
"projects are turning a profit. Measuring **project profitability** involves "
"keeping track of the costs of resources used to carry out the project, such "
"as employee costs, materials used, purchases, expenses, or after-sales "
"services, and comparing them with the project revenues."
msgstr ""
"在处理可计费项目时,确定项目是否盈利至关重要。衡量**项目盈利能力**需要跟踪执行"
"项目所用资源的成本,如员工成本、使用的材料、采购、费用或售后服务,并将其与项目"
"收入进行比较。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:10
msgid ""
"Project profitability is tracked in the :doc:`project dashboard "
"<project_dashboard>` on all billable projects."
msgstr ""
"项目盈利能力在所有可计费项目的:doc:`项目仪表板 <project_dashboard>`中跟踪。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:13
msgid ""
"To access the :doc:`project dashboard <project_dashboard>`, open the "
"**Project** app and navigate to the applicable project. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"sliders` (:guilabel:`sliders`) icon to add :guilabel:`Dashboard` to the "
"project's :ref:`top bar <project/project-management/top-bar>`."
msgstr ""
"要访问:doc:`项目仪表板 <project_dashboard>`,打开**项目**应用并导航到相应项"
"目。点击:icon:`fa-sliders`(:guilabel:`滑块`)图标,将:guilabel:`仪表板`添加到项"
"目的:ref:`顶部栏 <project/project-management/top-bar>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:18
msgid ""
"You can also access the :doc:`project dashboard <project_dashboard>` by "
"hovering over the desired project’s card, clicking the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`), and selecting :guilabel:`Dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"你也可以通过将鼠标悬停在所需项目的卡片上,点击:icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v`(:guilabel:`垂直省略号`),然后选择:guilabel:`仪表板`来访问:doc:`项目仪表板 "
"<project_dashboard>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:22
msgid ""
"The **profitability dashboard** is on the right side of the project "
"dashboard and displays data for all records linked to the project and "
"its :doc:`analytic account </applications/finance/accounting/reporting/"
"analytic_accounting>`. It’s divided into two major sections: :ref:`revenues "
"<project/project-profitability/revenues>`, which displays a breakdown of "
"income generated by the project, and :ref:`costs <project/project-"
"profitability/costs>` accrued by your company. The same record can be "
"displayed in both sections, e.g., the same timesheet is listed "
"under :guilabel:`Revenues` with the amount the customer paid for the work "
"and under :guilabel:`Costs` with the amount of wages paid to the employees."
msgstr ""
"**盈利能力仪表板**位于项目仪表板右侧,显示链接到项目及其:doc:`分析账户 </"
"applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting>`的所有记录的数"
"据。它分为两个主要部分::ref:`收入 <project/project-profitability/revenues>`,"
"显示项目产生的收入明细;以及公司产生的:ref:`成本 <project/project-"
"profitability/costs>`。同一记录可以显示在两个部分中,例如,同一工时单"
"在:guilabel:`收入`下列出客户为该工作支付的金额,在:guilabel:`成本`下列出支付给"
"员工的工资金额。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:32
msgid "Project dashboard."
msgstr "项目仪表板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:35
msgid ""
"The amounts displayed in the profitability report are divided into three "
"columns:"
msgstr "盈利能力报告中显示的金额分为三列:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expected`: the amounts expected based on existing sales or "
"purchase orders."
msgstr ":guilabel:`预期`:基于现有销售或采购订单的预期金额。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`To invoice` (revenues) or :guilabel:`To bill` (costs): the "
"amounts are moved to this column when the work or goods have been delivered, "
"e.g., a :doc:`timesheet </applications/services/timesheets>` has been "
"created and/or validated, a delivery order has been marked as done, or the "
"delivered quantity has been manually updated on the sales order."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`待开票`(收入)或:guilabel:`待计费`(成本):当工作或货物已交付时,金额"
"会移至此列,例如,:doc:`工时单 </applications/services/timesheets>`已创建和/或"
"验证、交付单已标记为完成,或销售订单上的交付数量已手动更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invoiced` or :guilabel:`Billed`: the amounts are moved to this "
"column once an invoice or bill has been confirmed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已开票`或:guilabel:`已计费`:一旦发票或账单确认,金额会移至此列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:46
msgid ""
"Based on the same principle, the revenues section is further divided "
"into :guilabel:`Sold`, :guilabel:`Delivered`, and :guilabel:`Invoiced` "
"columns. Use the :icon:`fa-caret-right` (:guilabel:`arrow`) icon to see a "
"detailed breakdown for each line."
msgstr ""
"基于相同原则,收入部分进一步分为:guilabel:`已售`、:guilabel:`已交付`"
"和:guilabel:`已开票`列。使用:icon:`fa-caret-right`(:guilabel:`箭头`)图标查看"
"每行的详细明细。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:51
msgid ""
"Use the project’s :ref:`top bar <project/project-management/top-bar>` to "
"easily access and edit records linked to the project’s profitability from "
"the project’s Kanban view."
msgstr ""
"使用项目的:ref:`顶部栏 <project/project-management/top-bar>`从项目的看板视图"
"轻松访问和编辑与项目盈利能力相关的记录。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:55
msgid ""
"In order for a record to be displayed on the profitability dashboard, it "
"must be linked to the project and its :doc:`analytic account </applications/"
"finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting>`."
msgstr ""
"为了使记录显示在盈利能力仪表板上,它必须链接到项目及其:doc:`分析账户 </"
"applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:58
msgid "The following records can be displayed in the profitability dashboard."
msgstr "盈利能力仪表板中可以显示以下记录。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:63
msgid "Revenues"
msgstr "收入"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Timesheets`: revenues from :doc:`timesheets </applications/"
"services/timesheets>`, broken down according to the :guilabel:`Invoicing "
"Policy` selected on the product form (e.g., :doc:`Prepaid/Fixed Price </"
"applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy>`, :doc:`Based on "
"Timesheets </applications/sales/sales/invoicing/"
"time_materials>`, :doc:`Based on Milestones </applications/sales/sales/"
"invoicing/milestone>`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工时单`:来自:doc:`工时单 </applications/services/timesheets>`的收"
"入,根据产品表单上选择的:guilabel:`开票政策`进行细分(例如,:doc:`预付/固定价格 "
"</applications/sales/sales/invoicing/invoicing_policy>`、:doc:`基于工时单 </"
"applications/sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials>`、:doc:`基于里程碑 </"
"applications/sales/sales/invoicing/milestone>`)。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Materials`: total of sales prices of products sold via sales "
"orders linked to the project."
msgstr ":guilabel:`材料`:通过链接到项目的销售订单销售的产品销售价格总额。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer invoices`: a total of invoices linked to the project."
msgstr ":guilabel:`客户发票`:与项目关联的发票总额。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:73
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Subscriptions`: a total of sales prices of :doc:`subscriptions </"
"applications/sales/subscriptions>` linked to the project."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`订阅`:与项目关联的:doc:`订阅 </applications/sales/subscriptions>`"
"销售价格总额。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Down payments`: a total of :doc:`down payments </applications/"
"sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment>` linked to the project."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`预付款`:与项目关联的:doc:`预付款 </applications/sales/sales/"
"invoicing/down_payment>`总额。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expenses`: any :doc:`expenses </applications/finance/expenses>` "
"that have been reinvoiced to the customer."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`费用`：任何已向客户重新开票的 :doc:`费用 </applications/finance/"
"expenses>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:83
msgid "Costs"
msgstr "成本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Timesheets`: total cost of time tracked by employees "
"via :doc:`timesheets </applications/services/timesheets>`, based on the "
"employee's :ref:`HR settings <employees/hr-settings>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工时单`:员工通过:doc:`工时单 </applications/services/timesheets>`"
"跟踪的时间总成本,基于员工的:ref:`人力资源设置 <employees/hr-settings>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Orders`: total cost of :doc:`purchase orders </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/purchase/manage_deals>` linked to the "
"project. Those could cover goods, materials, or even subcontracted services. "
"This entry only appears once the vendor bill is posted."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`采购订单`:与项目关联的:doc:`采购订单 </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/purchase/manage_deals>`总成本。这些可能涵盖货物、材料甚至分"
"包服务。此条目仅在供应商账单过账后显示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Materials`: total cost of products included in :doc:`stock moves "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving>` (deliveries "
"and receipts) that have been validated for the project. This section is only "
"displayed if :guilabel:`Analytic Costs` have been enabled "
"in :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Operations Types` for "
"applicable operations. This ensures that the product's cost is tracked "
"during the stock move."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`材料`:项目已验证的:doc:`库存移动 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving>`(交付和收货)中包含的产品总成本。仅当"
"在:menuselection:`库存 --> 配置 --> 操作类型`中为适用操作启用了:guilabel:`分"
"析成本`时,才会显示此部分。这确保在库存移动期间跟踪产品成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expenses`: total costs of :doc:`expenses </applications/finance/"
"expenses>` linked to the project that have been submitted and approved."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`费用`:与项目关联且已提交和批准的:doc:`费用 </applications/finance/"
"expenses>`总成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:100
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor bills`: total costs of :doc:`vendor bills </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/purchase/manage_deals/manage>` linked to the project's "
"analytic account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`供应商账单`:与项目分析账户关联的:doc:`供应商账单 </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/purchase/manage_deals/manage>`总成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:103
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manufacturing orders`: total costs of manufacturing orders linked "
"to the project's analytic account."
msgstr ":guilabel:`制造订单`:与项目分析账户关联的制造订单总成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_profitability.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other costs`: any other costs linked to the project's analytic "
"account."
msgstr ":guilabel:`其他成本`:与项目分析账户关联的任何其他成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:3
msgid "Project templates"
msgstr "项目模板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:5
msgid ""
"Templates allow you to create new projects with predefined settings, "
"reducing the need to manually set up similar projects repeatedly."
msgstr "模板允许您使用预定义的设置创建新项目，减少重复手动设置类似项目的需要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:9
msgid "Creating templates"
msgstr "创建模板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:11
msgid ""
"To create a project template, an existing project is required and used as a "
"base to be converted into a template. Converting a project into a template "
"transfers the entire project's properties to the template. This includes the "
"project’s stages, tasks, sub-tasks, and their respective configurations, "
"such as planned dates, statuses, assignees, and more."
msgstr ""
"要创建项目模板，需要一个现有项目作为基础并将其转换为模板。将项目转换为模板会"
"将整个项目的属性转移到模板中。这包括项目的阶段、任务、子任务及其各自的配置，"
"例如计划日期、状态、受托人等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:16
msgid ""
"First, access the settings of the project that you want to convert into a "
"template by going to :guilabel:`Projects`, hovering your mouse over the "
"project's card, clicking the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon, and selecting :guilabel:`Settings`. Review and adjust the "
"project’s properties to ensure it reflects your desired template setup."
msgstr ""
"首先，通过转到\\ :guilabel:`项目`，将鼠标悬停在项目卡片上，点击\\ :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v`\\ （:guilabel:`垂直省略号`）图标，然后选择\\ :guilabel:`设置`，来"
"访问您想要转换为模板的项目的设置。审查并调整项目的属性，以确保它反映您期望的"
"模板设置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:21
msgid ""
"Once your project is ready, click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`cog`) icon "
"and select :guilabel:`Convert to Template`. The :guilabel:`Template` banner "
"indicates that the project has been successfully converted into a template."
msgstr ""
"项目准备就绪后，点击\\ :icon:`fa-cog`\\ （:guilabel:`齿轮`）图标并选择"
"\\ :guilabel:`转换为模板`。:guilabel:`模板`\\ 横幅表明该项目已成功转换为模"
"板。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:26
msgid ""
"Converting a project into a template will also archive the original project "
"used to create the template. To keep using a project that you want to "
"convert into a template, duplicate it first by hovering your mouse over the "
"project's card, clicking the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon, and selecting :guilabel:`Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
"将项目转换为模板也会归档用于创建模板的原始项目。要继续使用您想要转换为模板的"
"项目，请先复制它，方法是将鼠标悬停在项目卡片上，点击\\ :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v`\\ （:guilabel:`垂直省略号`）图标，然后选择\\ :guilabel:`复制`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:32
msgid ""
"To edit or delete a template, go to :menuselection:`Projects --> New`. Next "
"to the name of the template, click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`pencil`) icon to edit it or the :icon:`fa-trash` "
"(:guilabel:`trash`) icon to delete it. Editing or deleting a template does "
"not affect the projects that were previously created from it."
msgstr ""
"要编辑或删除模板，转到\\ :menuselection:`项目 --> 新建`。在模板名称旁边，点击"
"\\ :icon:`fa-pencil`\\ （:guilabel:`铅笔`）图标进行编辑，或点击\\ :icon:`fa-"
"trash`\\ （:guilabel:`垃圾桶`）图标删除它。编辑或删除模板不会影响之前从该模板"
"创建的项目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:38
msgid "Project roles in templates"
msgstr "模板中的项目角色"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:40
msgid ""
"Templates enable you to pre-select specific roles for tasks within your "
"template, making the selection of assignees faster during the creation of a "
"new project using a template."
msgstr ""
"模板使您能够为模板中的任务预先选择特定角色，从而在使用模板创建新项目时更快地"
"选择执行人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:43
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Projects --> New`, and click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`pencil`) icon next to the name of the template you want to edit. "
"Then click on the :guilabel:`Tasks` smart button, and on one of the tasks. "
"In the :guilabel:`Project Roles` field, type or select the roles that you "
"want to perform this task, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`项目 --> 新建`，点击要编辑的模板名称旁边的:icon:`fa-"
"pencil`（:guilabel:`铅笔`）图标。然后点击:guilabel:`任务`智能按钮，并点击其中"
"一个任务。在:guilabel:`项目角色`字段中，输入或选择要执行此任务的角色，然后点"
"击:guilabel:`保存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:48
msgid ""
"Create a project based on this template: go to :menuselection:`Projects --> "
"New`, and click on the name of the template. The :guilabel:`Create a project "
"from template` form then includes :guilabel:`Project Roles`. For each of "
"them, you can select assignees by clicking on the :guilabel:`Assignees` "
"field. This automatically dispatches the right tasks to the right employees."
msgstr ""
"基于此模板创建项目：前往:menuselection:`项目 --> 新建`，点击模板名"
"称。:guilabel:`从模板创建项目`表单将包含:guilabel:`项目角色`。对于每个角色，"
"您可以通过点击:guilabel:`执行人`字段来选择执行人。这将自动把正确的任务分配给"
"正确的员工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:54
msgid "Task scheduling in templates"
msgstr "模板中的任务排期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:56
msgid ""
"In a project template, task scheduling can be automated according to the "
"planned dates specified within the template."
msgstr "在项目模板中，任务排期可以根据模板中指定的计划日期自动完成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:60
msgid ""
"Project and task planned dates are not saved when converting a project into "
"a template. These require to be added to the template after it is created."
msgstr ""
"将项目转换为模板时，项目和任务的计划日期不会保存。这些日期需要在模板创建后添"
"加到模板中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:63
msgid ""
"On the project template, define the :guilabel:`Planned dates` for both the "
"project and each task. When tasks have planned start dates in the template, "
"Odoo calculates the number of days between the project’s start date and the "
"first scheduled task. This time window is referred to as the *delta*."
msgstr ""
"在项目模板上，为项目和每个任务定义 :guilabel:`计划日期`。当模板中的任务具有计"
"划开始日期时，Odoo 会计算项目开始日期与第一个计划任务之间的天数。此时间窗口称"
"为*增量*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:68
msgid "When a new project is generated from this template:"
msgstr "从此模板生成新项目时："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:70
msgid "The system uses the project’s start date as a reference."
msgstr "系统使用项目的开始日期作为参考。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:71
msgid "Each task’s start date is automatically planned according to its delta."
msgstr "每个任务的开始日期根据其时间差自动计划。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:72
msgid ""
"If no start date is set on the new project, the current date is used as the "
"default start date."
msgstr "如果新项目未设置开始日期，则使用当前日期作为默认开始日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:73
msgid ""
"Task end dates are then determined automatically by Odoo’s scheduling "
"algorithm."
msgstr "然后，任务的结束日期由 Odoo 的排期算法自动确定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:76
msgid ""
"To ensure that all project roles and tasks are planned without conflict "
"according to the team’s availability and workload, the scheduling algorithm "
"calculates the end date of each task based on the allocated time, while also "
"considering task dependencies and assignee’s availability, working schedule, "
"time off, and public holidays."
msgstr ""
"为确保所有项目角色和任务根据团队的可用性和工作量进行无冲突规划，排期算法会根"
"据分配的时间计算每个任务的结束日期，同时考虑任务依赖关系以及执行人的可用性、"
"工作时间表、休息时间和公共假期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:82
msgid ""
"`Magic Sheet - Schedule tasks based on template [PDF] <https://"
"drive.google.com/drive/folders/1i6u_Qi7zHr1_btDuPhiK_LgLoAFKioIw>`_"
msgstr ""
"`魔法表 - 基于模板安排任务 [PDF]<https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/"
"1i6u_Qi7zHr1_btDuPhiK_LgLoAFKioIw>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:86
msgid "Using templates"
msgstr "使用模板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:88
msgid ""
"To create a new project from a template, go to :menuselection:`Projects --> "
"New`, and click on a template in the :guilabel:`Project Templates` section. "
"Enter a name for your project. Optionally, add a :guilabel:`Customer`, "
"a :guilabel:`Planned Date`, and set up the task creation email. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Create Project`."
msgstr ""
"要从模板创建新项目，前往:menuselection:`项目 --> 新建`，然后在:guilabel:`项目"
"模板`部分点击一个模板。输入项目名称。您还可以选择添加:guilabel:`客户"
"`、:guilabel:`计划日期`并设置任务创建邮件。然后，点击:guilabel:`创建项目`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:93
msgid ""
"Templates can also be linked to specific products. To do so, the project "
"template must be set as :guilabel:`Billable`:"
msgstr "模板也可以链接到特定产品。为此，项目模板必须设置为:guilabel:`可计费`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:96
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Projects --> New` and click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`pencil`) icon next to the name of the template you want to edit."
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`项目 --> 新建`，点击要编辑的模板名称旁边的:icon:`fa-"
"pencil`（:guilabel:`铅笔`）图标。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:98
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Settings` tab, tick the :guilabel:`Billable` checkbox, "
"and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"点击:guilabel:`设置`选项卡，勾选:guilabel:`可计费`复选框，然后点击:guilabel:`"
"保存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:101
msgid "Once this is done, configure the product by:"
msgstr "完成后，通过以下方式配置产品："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:103
msgid "Selecting :guilabel:`Service` as the :guilabel:`Product Type`."
msgstr "选择:guilabel:`服务`作为:guilabel:`产品类型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:104
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`Project` or :guilabel:`Project & Task` in "
"the :guilabel:`Create on Order` field."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`生成订单时` 字段中选择 :guilabel:`项目` 或 :guilabel:`项目和任"
"务`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/project_management/project_templates.rst:105
msgid "Selecting a :guilabel:`Project Template` and clicking :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "选择一个 :guilabel:`项目模板` 并点击 :guilabel:`保存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks.rst:5
msgid "Task management"
msgstr "任务管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:3
msgid "Recurring tasks"
msgstr "经常性任务"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:5
msgid ""
"When handling a project, the same task often needs to be performed several "
"times: for example, weekly meetings or status reports. The **recurring "
"tasks** feature allows you to automate the creation of those tasks."
msgstr ""
"在处理项目时，经常需要多次执行相同的任务：例如，每周会议或状态报告。**经常性"
"任务**功能可让您自动创建这些任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Recurring tasks <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/"
"recurring-tasks-6958>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo 教程:重复任务 <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/recurring-"
"tasks-6958>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:15
msgid ""
"To use task dependencies in a project, go to :guilabel:`Project`, click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) icon on one of "
"your projects, and click on :guilabel:`Settings`. Click on "
"the :guilabel:`Settings` tab, look for :guilabel:`Tasks Management` and make "
"sure :guilabel:`Recurring Tasks` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"要在项目中使用任务依赖关系，请转到:guilabel:`项目`，点击某个项目上"
"的:icon:`fa-ellipsis-v`（:guilabel:`垂直省略号`）图标，然后点击:guilabel:`设"
"置`。点击:guilabel:`设置`标签页，查找:guilabel:`任务管理`并确保:guilabel:`重"
"复任务`已启用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:21
msgid "Set up task recurrence"
msgstr "设置任务重复周期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:23
msgid ""
"In an existing task, click the :icon:`fa-repeat` (:guilabel:`Recurrent`) "
"button next to the :guilabel:`Deadline` field. Then, configure "
"the :guilabel:`Repeat Every` field according to your needs."
msgstr ""
"在现有任务中,点击:guilabel:`截止日期`字段旁边的:icon:`fa-repeat`(:guilabel:`"
"重复`)按钮。然后根据需要配置:guilabel:`重复间隔`字段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:27
msgid ""
"A new task in recurrence will be created once the status of the previous "
"task is set to :guilabel:`Done` or :guilabel:`Canceled`."
msgstr ""
"一旦前一个任务的状态设置为:guilabel:`已完成`或:guilabel:`已取消`,就会创建新的"
"重复任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:30
msgid ""
"The new task is created on the project dashboard with the following "
"configuration:"
msgstr "新任务将在项目仪表板上创建,具有以下配置:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stage`: is set to the first stage of the project dashboard "
"(:guilabel:`New` or equivalent);"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`阶段`:设置为项目仪表板的第一个阶段(:guilabel:`新建`或同等阶段);"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`, :guilabel:`Description`, :guilabel:`Project`, :guilabel:`Assignees`, :guilabel:`Customer`, :guilabel:`Tags`: "
"are copied from the original task;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`名称`、:guilabel:`描述`、:guilabel:`项目`、:guilabel:`负责人"
"`、:guilabel:`客户`、:guilabel:`标签`:从原始任务复制;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Deadline`: is updated based on the :guilabel:`Repeat Every` field "
"(e.g., if the task is set to repeat once a week, 7 days will be added to the "
"deadline);"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`截止日期`:根据:guilabel:`重复间隔`字段更新(例如,如果任务设置为每周"
"重复一次,则截止日期会增加7天);"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Milestones`, :guilabel:`Timesheets`, :guilabel:`Chatter`, :guilabel:`Activities`, :guilabel:`Subtasks`: "
"are **not** copied from the original task."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`里程碑`、:guilabel:`工时单`、:guilabel:`讨论`、:guilabel:`活动"
"`、:guilabel:`子任务`:**不会**从原始任务复制。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:41
msgid ""
"Once a recurrence is configured, a **smart button** on the task displays the "
"total number of existing recurrences."
msgstr "配置重复后,任务上的**智能按钮**会显示现有重复的总数。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:45
msgid "Edit or stop task recurrence"
msgstr "编辑或停止任务循环"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:47
msgid ""
"**To edit** the recurrence, open the last task in recurrence. Any changes "
"made on the task will be applied to the tasks that will be created in the "
"future."
msgstr ""
"**要编辑**循环任务，打开循环任务中的最后一项任务。对该任务所做的任何更改都将"
"应用到今后创建的任务中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/recurring_tasks.rst:50
msgid ""
"**To stop** the recurrence, open the last task in recurrence and press "
"the :guilabel:`Recurrent` button next to the :guilabel:`Planned date`."
msgstr ""
"**要停止**循环，打开循环中的最后一项任务，按下:guilabel:`计划日期`旁边"
"的:guilabel:`经常性`按钮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/sub-tasks.rst:3
msgid "Sub-tasks"
msgstr "子任务"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/sub-tasks.rst:5
msgid ""
"When handling project tasks, you can often benefit from splitting the "
"workload into smaller **sub-tasks**, making it easier to track progress and "
"manage the work."
msgstr ""
"在处理项目任务时,通常可以将工作量拆分为更小的**子任务**,从而更轻松地跟踪进度"
"和管理工作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/sub-tasks.rst:8
msgid ""
"Odoo’s sub-task feature is particularly useful in some of the following "
"cases:"
msgstr "Odoo的子任务功能在以下情况中特别有用："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/sub-tasks.rst:10
msgid "The task workload is too big to handle in one record."
msgstr "任务工作量太大，无法在一条记录中处理。"

