#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:3
msgid "Task creation"
msgstr "创建任务"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:5
msgid ""
"Tasks in Odoo Project can be created manually or automatically, including "
"from emails or website forms."
msgstr "Odoo 项目中的任务可以手动或自动创建,包括从电子邮件或网站表单创建。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:9
msgid "Manual task creation"
msgstr "手动创建任务"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:11
msgid ""
"Open the Project app and choose the desired project. Create a new task by "
"doing one of the following:"
msgstr "打开项目应用并选择所需的项目。通过以下方式之一创建新任务:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:14
msgid ""
"Clicking the :icon:`fa-plus` (:guilabel:`plus`) button in the upper left "
"corner. This creates a new task in the first stage of your Kanban view."
msgstr ""
"点击左上角的 :icon:`fa-plus` (:guilabel:`加号`) 按钮。这将在看板视图的第一个"
"阶段创建新任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:16
msgid ""
"Pressing the :icon:`fa-plus` (:guilabel:`plus`) button next to the Kanban "
"stage name. This creates a new task in this Kanban stage."
msgstr ""
"点击看板阶段名称旁边的 :icon:`fa-plus` (:guilabel:`加号`) 按钮。这将在该看板"
"阶段创建新任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:19
msgid ""
"Fill in the :guilabel:`Task Title` and add one or "
"more :guilabel:`Assignees`, then click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"填写 :guilabel:`任务标题` 并添加一个或多个 :guilabel:`负责人`,然后点"
"击 :guilabel:`添加`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:25
msgid "Task configuration"
msgstr "任务配置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:27
msgid ""
"Click the task to open it. The task form includes the following fields that "
"you can fill in:"
msgstr "点击任务将其打开。任务表单包含以下可以填写的字段:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:29
msgid ":guilabel:`Task Title`: title of the task."
msgstr ":guilabel:`任务标题`:任务的标题。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:30
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-star-o` (:guilabel:`Star`): click the :icon:`fa-star-o` "
"(:guilabel:`star`) icon to mark the task as high priority. The icon will "
"turn yellow. Click it again to remove the high priority."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-star-o` (:guilabel:`星标`):点击 :icon:`fa-star-o` (:guilabel:`星标"
"`) 图标将任务标记为高优先级。图标将变为黄色。再次点击可移除高优先级。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:32
msgid ":guilabel:`Project`: the project that this task belongs to."
msgstr ":guilabel:`项目`:此任务所属的项目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Assignees`: the person(s) in charge of handling the work on this "
"task."
msgstr ":guilabel:`负责人`:负责处理此任务工作的人员。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: custom labels allowing to categorize and filter your tasks."
msgstr ":guilabel:`标签`:用于分类和筛选任务的自定义标签。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: the person or company that will be billed for this "
"task. This field only appears in tasks that belong to billable projects."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`客户`:将为此任务付费的个人或公司。此字段仅出现在属于计费项目的任务"
"中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Order Item`: this can be either the sales order that was "
"used to create this task, or a sales order that was linked to this task "
"manually. This field only appears in tasks linked to billable projects."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`销售订单项`:这可以是用于创建此任务的销售订单,或手动链接到此任务的"
"销售订单。此字段仅出现在链接到计费项目的任务中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allocated Time`: the amount of time that the work on this task is "
"expected to last, tracked by timesheets."
msgstr ":guilabel:`分配时间`:此任务的工作预计持续的时间,由工时单跟踪。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Deadline`: the expected end date of the task. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Deadline` field to select the task's end date in the dropdown "
"calendar. To define the task's duration, including its start and end dates "
"(and optionally specific times), click the :icon:`fa-calendar-plus-o` "
"(:guilabel:`fa-calendar-plus-o`) icon in the dropdown calendar, select the "
"dates and times, then click  :guilabel:`Apply` to save."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`截止日期`：任务的预计结束日期。点击 :guilabel:`截止日期` 字段，在"
"下拉日历中选择任务的结束日期。要定义任务的持续时间，包括其开始和结束日期（以"
"及可选的具体时间），请点击下拉日历中的 :icon:`fa-calendar-plus-o` "
"(:guilabel:`fa-calendar-plus-o`) 图标，选择日期和时间，然后点击 :guilabel:`应"
"用` 以保存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:50
msgid ""
"You can also create new tasks by switching to the list or Gantt view and "
"clicking :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"您还可以通过切换到列表或甘特图视图并点击 :guilabel:`新建` 来创建新任务。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:52
msgid ""
"The following fields can also be edited directly from the Kanban view "
"without opening the individual task: :icon:`fa-star-o` "
"(**priority**), :guilabel:`Allocated hours`, :guilabel:`Assignees`, and "
"**task status**. You can also **color code** or :guilabel:`Set a Cover "
"image` to your task by clicking the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (**vertical "
"ellipsis**)."
msgstr ""
"以下字段也可以直接在看板视图中编辑,无需打开单个任务::icon:`fa-star-o` (**优先"
"级**)、:guilabel:`分配小时数`、:guilabel:`负责人` 和**任务状态**。您还可以通"
"过点击 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (**垂直省略号**) 对任务进行**颜色编码**"
"或 :guilabel:`设置封面图片`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:56
msgid ""
"You can use the following keyboard shortcuts in the task title to configure "
"new tasks (modify the values in the examples below according to your needs):"
msgstr ""
"您可以在任务标题中使用以下键盘快捷方式来配置新任务(根据需要修改以下示例中的"
"值):"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:59
msgid "**30h**: to allocate 30 hours to the task."
msgstr "**30h**:为任务分配 30 小时。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:60
msgid "**#tags**: to add tags to the task."
msgstr "**#标签**：向任务添加标签。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:61
msgid "**@user**: to assign the task to a user."
msgstr "**@用户**：将任务分配给用户。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:62
msgid "**!**: to star the task as high priority."
msgstr "**!**：将任务标记为高优先级。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:64
msgid ""
"Along with using the correct format, follow this order: the task's name, "
"followed by the allocated time, the tags, the assignee, and then the "
"priority."
msgstr ""
"除了使用正确的格式外，请遵循以下顺序：任务名称、分配的时间、标签、分配人，然"
"后是优先级。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/project/tasks/task_creation.rst:67
msgid ""
"For example, if you want to create a task named \"Prepare workshop\", "
"allocate 5h hours to it, add the \"School\" tag, assign it to Audrey and set "
"its priority to :guilabel:`High`, enter the following task title: Prepare "
"workshop 5h #school @Audrey !"
msgstr ""
"例如，如果您想创建一个名为“Prepare workshop”的任务，分配 5 小时，添"
"加“School”标签，将其分配给 Audrey 并将其优先级设置为:guilabel:`高`，请输入以"
"下任务标题：Prepare workshop 5h #school @Audrey !"

